=== m2_msd_family.sage : the criterion class in the MTT normalisation ===
sage version      : SageMath version 10.7, Release Date: 2025-08-09
curve             : E : y^2 = x^3 - -39x   [0,0,0,39,0]
conductor         : 48672
normalisation     : MTT / Stein-Wuthrich, real Neron period (Sage padic_lseries)
series precision  : n = 3, so c_2 is certified modulo p^2

kappa(p) = 2 c_2(p) mod p is the criterion class times the comparison unit
c_p u(0) of lem:comparison.  Its vanishing is that of c(fp); its value is not.
The KAPPA lines below are the machine-readable form read by gp/m2_w1_family.gp.

p      a_p    c_2(p)                          v_p(c_2)  c_2 mod p  kappa(p)  time
